		{
			dependencies: [
				"5F145D9019C4BC48"
				"31B4B834D5DD87DB"
			]
			description: [
		"When you look at it, you seem to see the bearded doll that was on the shelf in the Pan-Galaxy GregTech sales department many galactic years ago."
		""
		"&a &l If you still plan to challenge the later star gates, you have to pay attention to the various infinite components in JEI. There are also various component packages. Some machines only need to be made. For example, the black hole does not need to be built. Just replace the black hole component package."
		""
		"&l &b In the process of making the star gate, you may encounter a situation where the calculated but unable to place an order shows missing materials but does not show what materials are missing. This is caused by the special optimization algorithm of gtlcore. At this time, you need to place separate orders for the materials. For example, if material A requires 1 2 3 4 5, you can place the order separately. 1 2 3 4 5 Every time you order 1000000, you will know what materials you are missing."
	]
