		"&lhas a \"hyperdimensional operation\" mode, which requires continuous running of&efor 4 hours in the real world and&7to complete the process."
		"&lcan perform&6ultra-dimensional smelting &7,&6stellar thermal energy smelting &7,&6ultimate material forging&7three types of formulas"
		"&lcan be installed with&6stellar jet melting core &7,&astellar thermal energy plasma manufacturing machine &7,&cstellar flame energy furnace &7,&4stellar fusion mutator &7,&3stellar phase dragon vein crystallizer&7and other modules"
		""
		"&7&oSome people say that when you exhaust all the materials in the world and light up that beam of light that spans the ages,"
		"&7&oYou might as well go and stand for a while in front of the furnace that can burn the history of the stars."
		"&7&oGive it a minute. It will burn out for you and it will stay for you."
	]
